    },
    "Both the Dock icon and Menu Bar icon are currently hidden. While LocalConvert stays open in the background, you can reopen its main window at any time by launching LocalConvert from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad. Press ⌘Q whenever you want to quit LocalConvert completely.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both the Dock icon and Menu Bar icon are currently hidden. While LocalConvert stays open in the background, you can reopen its main window at any time by launching LocalConvert from Finder, Spotlight, or Launchpad. Press ⌘Q whenever you want to quit LocalConvert completely."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hem Dock simgesi hem de Menü Çubuğu simgesi şu anda gizli. LocalConvert arka planda açık kalırken Finder, Spotlight veya Launchpad üzerinden başlatarak ana pencereyi istediğiniz zaman yeniden açabilirsiniz. LocalConvert'ten tamamen çıkmak istediğinizde ⌘Q tuşlarına basın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
